           / dancing weapon ; war axe / dancing weapon ; trident \
           / dancing weapon ; mace
KMONS: " = dancing weapon ; rapier / dancing weapon ; scimitar \
           / dancing weapon ; broad axe / dancing weapon ; halberd \
